    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674263266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to make a return.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70278,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674269466666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674271266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's 8675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70278,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674276266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Great, one moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see the order. It looks like you're wanting to return the VeloFit cycling shoes?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674277733332
    },
    {
      "text": "That's what I said.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70278,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674286599998
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. I see this purchase was made about 75 days ago. Could you tell me what the issue is with the shoes?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674288066664
    },
    {
      "text": "They're just awful. No matter how I adjust the cleats, they give me terrible blisters after every ride. I'm done with them.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70278,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674295266664
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that they've been so uncomfortable for you. Let me just check the return eligibility for you. One moment... Yes, it looks like our standard items have a 90-day return window.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674303666663
    },
    {
      "text": "So?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70278,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674316999996
    },
    {
      "text": "So, since you're at day 75, you're well within that window. I can go ahead and process this return for a full refund for you right now. No problem at all.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674317699996
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. About time something was simple.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70278,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674328166662
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just sent a prepaid return label to the email address on file. You can just print that out, package the shoes back in their box, and drop it off at the post office. Your refund will be issued as soon as our warehouse receives them.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674330899995
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. I'll get to it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70278,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766674346833328
